**🧧 Supported Versions:**
- 1.21.5
- 1.21.8
- 1.21.10
- 1.21.11 *[LTS]*
- 26.1 *[LTS]*
- 26.1.1 & 26.1.2
- 26.2
- 26.3
- 26.4-snapshot-8 *[TS]*

**🔌 Supported ModLoaders:**
- Fabric
- Forge
- NeoForge
- Sponge
- Paper

**🪵 Changelog:**
- [Loader] IFMLCowardlyEventStateListener service
- [Loader] IFMLLoadingExceptionListener service
- [Custom Payload API] Client-side payload bytearray size limit (default 2 KB, configurable with `@Size`)
- Update URLs for Forge & NeoForge
- Display URLs for Forge & NeoForge
- [Item Components] Transform SUSPICIOUS_STEW_EFFECTS
- [Screen API] Native element manipulation
- Update to 26.4-snapshot-8

